Dear Sir/Madam,

Greetings from Envision Enviro Technologies Pvt. Ltd.!

It gives us great pleasure to introduce Envision Enviro Technologies Pvt. L=
td., Surat, Gujarat, India, as a leading organization providing comprehensi=
ve solutions in the field of environmental engineering and pollution contro=
l.

We offer end-to-end services covering design, engineering, construction, er=
ection, and commissioning of Water and Wastewater Treatment Plants, includi=
ng Effluent Treatment Plants (ETP), Sewage Treatment Plants (STP), and Comm=
on Effluent Treatment Plants (CETP). Additionally, we specialize in the dev=
elopment of Secured/Sanitary Landfill Sites and Tailing Storage Facilities,=
 along with turnkey solutions for Incineration Systems for solid and hazard=
ous waste.

With over 32 years of extensive experience, we have successfully executed n=
umerous projects across India and internationally, including in Egypt, Bang=
ladesh, and Nigeria. We undertake projects on both consultancy and turnkey =
basis, ensuring high-quality, cost-effective, and environmentally compliant=
 solutions.

Our registered office is located in Surat (Gujarat), with branch offices at=
 Udaipur (Rajasthan), Guwahati (Assam), Faridabad (Haryana), Kalyan (Mumbai=
), Colva & Curchorem (Goa), and Dhaka (Bangladesh).

Our core areas of expertise include:

  *   Wastewater Treatment: STP, ETP, and Zero Liquid Discharge (ZLD) syste=
ms using advanced technologies such as MBR and MBBR
  *   Water Treatment: Reverse Osmosis (RO), UV systems, and allied technol=
ogies
  *   Preparation of Detailed Project Reports (DPR) along with Project Mana=
gement Consultancy (PMC) for Drainage Networks, ETP, STP, and CETP
  *   Consultancy services for obtaining Consent to Establish/Operate from =
State Pollution Control Boards
  *   Environmental Clearance (EC) consultancy from MoEF/State Authorities
  *   Incineration systems for solid and hazardous waste
  *   Monitoring and analysis of environmental parameters (air, water, and =
soil)
  *   Biomedical waste management and disposal
  *   Preparation of Carbon Footprint and Carbon Sequestration reports to s=
upport sustainability goals, ESG compliance, and carbon-neutral initiatives

We have also taken significant initiatives under Public-Private Partnership=
 (PPP) models, including the development of Common Plastic Waste Management=
 Centre in Surat in association with Surat Municipal Corporation, Vadodara =
Municipal Corporation, Ahmedabad Municipal Corporation, and Gandhinagar Mun=
icipal Corporation. These facilities operate in compliance with Plastic Was=
te Management Rules and ensure responsible processing and disposal.

Envision has been at the forefront of introducing innovative and path-break=
ing environmental solutions in India. Our early development of a Biomedical=
 Waste Treatment Facility during the late 1990s contributed to increased aw=
areness and played a role in shaping biomedical waste management practices =
in the country. Our Centralized Biomedical Waste Treatment Facility in Sura=
t was honored with the prestigious Dubai International Award for Best Pract=
ices in improving the living environment.

Furthermore, we are currently collaborating with the Sanand Industries Asso=
ciation (SIA) for the development of a Common Sewage Treatment Plant (CSTP)=
 at Sanand Industrial Estate. This project aims to provide industries with =
a centralized, efficient, and environmentally compliant sewage treatment so=
lution.

We have also delivered services to the semiconductor industries across prom=
inent locations, including Dholera and Sanand in Gujarat, along with projec=
t in Assam.

We would be delighted to explore opportunities to serve your esteemed organ=
ization and contribute to your environmental compliance and sustainability =
goals. We request the opportunity to meet you in person and present our cap=
abilities in detail.

Kindly find our company profile attached for your reference. For more infor=
mation, please visit our website: www.en-vision.in<http://www.en-vision.in>=
.

For any further queries or detailed discussions, please feel free to contac=
t Mr. Jinesh Shah (Mo. +91 9428001885) or the undersigned.

Thank you for your time and consideration. We look forward to the opportuni=
ty of working with you.

Thanking you,


