<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal"><span lang=3D"EN-US">Dear Sir/Madam,</span></p>
<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal"><span lang=3D"EN-US"><b>Greetings from Envision En=
viro Technologies Pvt. Ltd.!</b></span></p>
<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal"><span lang=3D"EN-US">It gives us great pleasure to=
 introduce
<b>Envision Enviro Technologies Pvt. Ltd., Surat, Gujarat</b>, India, as a =
leading organization providing c<b>omprehensive solutions in the field of e=
nvironmental engineering and pollution control.</b></span></p>
<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal"><span lang=3D"EN-US">We offer end-to-end services =
covering design, engineering, construction, erection, and commissioning of
<b>Water and Wastewater Treatment Plants</b>, including <b>Effluent Treatme=
nt Plants (ETP), Sewage Treatment Plants (STP), and Common Effluent Treatme=
nt Plants (CETP).</b> Additionally, we specialize in the development of
<b>Secured/Sanitary Landfill Sites and Tailing Storage Facilities</b>, alon=
g with turnkey solutions for Incineration Systems for solid and hazardous w=
aste.</span></p>
<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal"><span lang=3D"EN-US">With over 32 years of extensi=
ve experience, we have successfully
<b>executed numerous projects across India and internationally, including i=
n Egypt, Bangladesh, and Nigeria.
</b>We undertake projects on both consultancy and turnkey basis, ensuring h=
igh-quality, cost-effective, and environmentally compliant solutions.</span=
></p>
<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal"><span lang=3D"EN-US">Our <b>registered office is l=
ocated in Surat (Gujarat)</b>, with branch offices at Udaipur (Rajasthan), =
