em (Goa), and Dhaka (Bangladesh).</span></p>
<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal"><b><span lang=3D"EN-US">Our core areas of expertis=
e include:</span></b></p>
<ul>
<li class=3D"x_MsoNormal"><span lang=3D"EN-US"><b>Wastewater Treatment</b>:=
 STP, ETP, and Zero Liquid Discharge (ZLD) systems using advanced technolog=
ies such as MBR and MBBR</span></li><li class=3D"x_MsoNormal"><span lang=3D=
"EN-US"></span><span lang=3D"EN-US">Water Treatment: Reverse Osmosis (RO), =
UV systems, and allied technologies</span></li><li class=3D"x_MsoNormal"><s=
pan lang=3D"EN-US"></span><span lang=3D"EN-US">Preparation of Detailed Proj=
ect Reports (DPR) along with Project Management Consultancy (PMC) for Drain=
age Networks, ETP, STP, and CETP</span></li><li class=3D"x_MsoNormal"><span=
 lang=3D"EN-US"></span><b><span lang=3D"EN-US">Consultancy services for obt=
